NOTE: 

The command 

  mesh_confined_cylinder < meshinput1.txt

generates the mesh for cylinder1.

cylinder_post is the post_processing programs for cylinder1

streamfunction is for cylinder1


The examples in this directory are NOT described in the userguide.


Short description
-----------------

cylinder1:

 2D viscoelastic problem: flow around a cylinder confined between two walls.
 The problem uses a TFEM generated mesh.
 This is the benchmark problem with an Oldroyd-B beta=0.59.
